    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30569" root="عمل" body-key="E">
    
      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تعمّل</span></b>  <i>He suffered fatigue,</i> or <i>difficulty;</i> and
<i>strove, laboured,</i> or <i>toiled;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعَنَّى</span>, (O, K,
TA,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِجْتَهَدَ</span>; (TA;) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِكَذَا</span> [<i>for such a thing</i>];
(S, O;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِنْ أَجْلِهِ</span> [<i>on his account,</i> or <i>for his
sake</i>]; (K;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فِى حَاجَتِهِ</span> [<i>in the case of his
object of want</i>]. (TA.)

